{"id":"603372","name":"炒牛肉河粉","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/603372/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河粉","amount":"3包"},{"name":"牛腩","amount":"300可"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：红彩椒，河粉，牛腩。","img":"images/603372/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛腩除去颈膜切片后，下油锅快速翻炒，加入食盐和料酒，断生后盛出。","img":"images/603372/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备葱姜蒜末。","img":"images/603372/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"另起锅烧油炒香葱姜蒜末。","img":"images/603372/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入红椒丝和包菜丝翻炒。","img":"images/603372/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入河粉翻炒。","img":"images/603372/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入2勺生抽。","img":"images/603372/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"勺老抽。","img":"images/603372/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"勺蚝油。","img":"images/603372/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"半勺十三香。","img":"images/603372/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"半勺鸡精。","img":"images/603372/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"下入牛腩肉翻炒均匀。","img":"images/603372/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"关火盛盘。","img":"images/603372/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/603372/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}